/.DS_Store
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.png
**/documentation/*
*.md
__pycache__/
.vscode/*
**/_backup_*/
*.lic
# Local run output and reference logs — never committed.
**/_scratch/
**/_baseline/
*.rData
*scratch/*    
*.trig
*.rdfox

# ── Exceptions to the blanket *.csv rule above ───────────────────────────
#
# The blanket rule keeps real clinical data out of the repository and stays.
# Blueprint identity (device model + label + priority,
# old/PLAN_blueprint_identity.md): the gateway-name -> model mapping and
# the p99 consensus annotation the knowledge base is built from (alarm labels
# and expert annotations only), and the p99 corpus selection it annotates
# (alarm label, department, priority, device and an aggregate alarm count per
# row; no patient-level data). Both are inputs of build_framework.py and of
# MDA-POC/engine/regression.py's blueprint-identity check.
!DATA/ANNOTATION/device_models.csv
!DATA/ANNOTATION/consensus/p99_annotated.csv
!DATA/CORPUS/Annotation_corpus_99.csv
# Documentation, not output; the blanket *.md rule above would otherwise keep
# these out of the repository.
!/README.md
!MDA-POC/README.md
# Case design workbook (premises per rule, hand-written; case table generated by
# MDA-POC/validation/case_design.py), an exception to the blanket *.xlsx rule.
!MDA-POC/validation/case_design.xlsx
*_scratch*
*.DS_Store
*.docx
*.pdf
*.json


# ── Local-only folders ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Retired material, drafts and loose files: kept on disk, not published.
# MANUSCRIPT/scripts/ is the exception: it produces Tables 3/4, the filter
# comparison, the appendix and the figures, and README step 6 runs it.
/old/
/MISC/
/MANUSCRIPT/*
!/MANUSCRIPT/scripts/
